     "text": "Previously, on the Keeper’s Island."
    },
    {
     "id": "p2",
     "text": "Every night at three twelve, the lamp went dark for twelve seconds, and a boat ran onto the north rocks."
    },
    {
     "id": "p3",
     "text": "The clues led under the headland, to a door older than the tower. And a stranger in a yellow coat who casts no shadow."
    },
    {
     "id": "p4",
     "text": "Three days were up. And Gus walked into the dark on purpose.",
     "pause": 0.4
    }
